
  LUNAR OS  live medium

  Install Lunar OS       desktop icon, or run: sudo lunar-setup
  Manual steps           lunar-setup --steps
  Memory report          lunar-setup --memory

  If the desktop did not start, you are on the rescue console.
  Run: lunar-diagnose

  Live session runs as "lunar" with no password. Root is reachable from
  the local console only. sshd is not installed and the firewall drops
  all inbound traffic.

